:: Mom Office Vent [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1300,3400","size":"100,100"}
/* Inline micro event in the Stage 1 main room (micro event 40, "A normal workday" in Define Events): she stops
   right under the vent with her eyes closed, and likes the air. Only while the vent unit runs. Once she is past
   her first corruption stage, the meeting room slips into what she says. */
<div class="activity-image-wrapper" style="max-height: 400px">
	<<DisplayActivity $mom>>
</div>
<p>$mom.callName is standing in the middle of the main room with a stack of folders in her arms, going nowhere. Her eyes are closed. She's right underneath the vent, and the air coming out of it lifts a few loose strands of hair off her forehead and lets them fall again.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $player, text: "Everything okay?" },
	{ who: $mom, text: "Hm? Oh! Yes. Sorry, honey, I was just..." },
	{ text: "She doesn't move, though. She doesn't even open her eyes." },
	{ who: $mom, text: "Does it smell different in here to you? Not in a bad way. It's clean, like outside after it rains. I swear I think better right on this spot. Isn't that silly?" },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<br>
<div id="mom-vent-choice" class="choices">
	<div>
		<<link "Tell her it's the filters">>
			<<replace "#mom-vent-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "It's the new filters. $landlord.callName finally had them changed." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Well, tell him thank you from me." },
					{ text: "Then she remembers who she'd be thanking, and when, and in what way. Her nose wrinkles." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Actually, don't. I'll... I'll tell him myself." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She takes the folders to her desk. On her way, she slows down when she passes under the vent again, just slightly, like walking past a bakery.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomLust" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Tell her to stay as long as she likes">>
			<<replace "#mom-vent-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Then stay there for a minute. Nobody's timing you." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Don't tease me, sweetie." },
					{ who: $player, text: "I'm not teasing, I mean it. The folders can wait five minutes." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She laughs, and she stays. I go back to my desk and watch her from there. She stands under it with the folders pressed against her chest until they start to slip, and her shoulders come down a little further with every breath.</p>
				<<if setup.corruptionStage("mom") >= 1>>
					<<silently>>
					<<set _msgs to [
						{ who: $mom, text: "I keep thinking about the meeting room." },
						{ text: "She says it to nobody, eyes still closed. Then she hears herself, and they open." },
						{ who: $mom, text: "The folders, I mean, they're supposed to go in the meeting room, that's where we keep the... the client folders." },
					]>>
					<</silently>>
					<<Chat _msgs>>
					<p>She takes them to her own desk instead.</p>
				<<else>>
					<p>When she finally walks to her desk, she's humming. She doesn't seem to notice she's doing it.</p>
				<</if>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomLust" 1>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
